WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
- I'm so excited for this show.

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:03.210
But welcome to the show, by
the way, welcome to our show.

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.287
- [Renata Notni] Thank you so much.

00:00:04.287 --> 00:00:05.120
- Yeah. Have you ever met Kevin?

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:05.953
- No.
- No

00:00:05.953 --> 00:00:07.694
- I mean, of... I'm a big fan of yours.

00:00:07.694 --> 00:00:09.009
- Nice to meet you. I'm
a huge fan of yours.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.260
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.250
- That was fantastic.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.420
- Thank you so much.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.740
I'm so happy to be here.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:14.969
- I know. We are very happy to have you.

00:00:14.969 --> 00:00:15.802
- [Renata Notni] Thank
you so much for having me.

00:00:15.802 --> 00:00:17.580
- I love the action pack, a
little humor in there too.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.650
But I'm gonna start with this,
because I just moved here.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.960
Do you have a favorite eating
spot, because he gave me some?

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:22.860
- I've got a lot.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.960
- Oh my God, I'm such a foodie person,

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.690
I'm always looking for food, like,

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:29.730
I always wanna try everything.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.940
Probably my favorite pizza spot is here,

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.105
Rubirosa, have you tried that one?

00:00:34.105 --> 00:00:35.071
- [Kelly Clarkson] Rubirosa?

00:00:35.071 --> 00:00:35.954
- [Renata Notni] Have you tried that one?

00:00:35.954 --> 00:00:36.787
- But when you say it

00:00:36.787 --> 00:00:37.679
it sounds like the
sexiest damn pizza ever.

00:00:37.679 --> 00:00:38.877
- [Kevin] It does sound like...

00:00:38.877 --> 00:00:39.827
(laughing)

00:00:39.827 --> 00:00:40.660
- [Kevin] It does.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:41.493
- [Kelly Clarkson] Have you had Rubirosa?

00:00:41.493 --> 00:00:42.465
- [Kevin] I have not
had it, I've not had it.

00:00:42.465 --> 00:00:43.298
- No?

00:00:43.298 --> 00:00:44.555
- But if I don't know, I got to know.

00:00:44.555 --> 00:00:45.600
- Do you like pizza?

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.347
- Look at me and ask that question again.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:49.410
(Kelly Clarkson and audience laughing)

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:51.893
- Oh God. Okay. You need to try that one.

00:00:51.893 --> 00:00:52.726
- [Kevin] Okay.

00:00:52.726 --> 00:00:54.306
- [Kelly Clarkson] I love
you so much. (laughing)

00:00:54.306 --> 00:00:57.300
- Sorry. So you grew up
with older brothers, right?

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.220
- I do, I have one older brother.

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.950
- Were they nice ones or did
they toughen you up or...

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.590
- Right now we have the best relationship,

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.960
but when we were kids
we were kind of like-

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:07.793
- [Kelly Clarkson] Rough.

00:01:07.793 --> 00:01:08.940
- [Renata Notni] Competitive.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:11.190
He's two years older, so yeah.

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:14.040
It was a great, a fun relationship.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:15.120
- I heard that you also...

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:17.340
I got family tattoos once
with my sister and my mother.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:18.639
I heard you got family tattoos.

00:01:18.639 --> 00:01:19.472
- Oh yeah, I do.

00:01:19.472 --> 00:01:20.305
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:01:20.305 --> 00:01:22.560
My symbol for my ranch is
almost identical to that.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.550
- [Renata Notni] You are kidding.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:25.200
Yeah, there you go.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.420
So those are my...

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.740
- I'm blown away right now.

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:30.240
It's like, "Is that mine?" I was-

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:31.073
- It's almost the same.

00:01:31.073 --> 00:01:31.906
Are you kidding me?

00:01:31.906 --> 00:01:33.120
- It's not the same, there's
an arrow at the top for mine.

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:34.440
But I was like, "What?"

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.450
- So those are our initials.

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:40.260
So it's Hector, the H, the L for Liliana

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:41.766
and R, Renata, my name.

00:01:41.766 --> 00:01:42.599
- Yeah.

00:01:42.599 --> 00:01:43.432
- This is incredible.

00:01:43.432 --> 00:01:44.265
I gotta show you guys this.

00:01:44.265 --> 00:01:45.266
(Kelly Clarkson and audience laughing)

00:01:45.266 --> 00:01:46.738
- Oh, my God, I love it.

00:01:46.738 --> 00:01:48.115
(Kelly Clarkson laughing and clapping)

00:01:48.115 --> 00:01:48.948
- I got this tattoo..

00:01:48.948 --> 00:01:49.781
- [Renata Notni] Do you have any tattoos?

00:01:49.781 --> 00:01:52.620
- No, no, no. No, this body's clean.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:53.682
- Clean. Your temple is free.

00:01:53.682 --> 00:01:55.170
- [Kevin] Yes.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.370
- I love it.

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:58.350
- Well, tell us about Zorro.

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.720
- Well, I'm so happy it's finally here.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.740
We shot for eight months
in Canary Island in Spain.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.020
I feel that we've seen
many versions of Zorro,

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:10.650
but this one is a very
modern, like, fresh,

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:14.373
full of action, diversity,
action, fightings.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.060
The thing that I love the
most about this new version

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:21.390
is that every single
female role in the story

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:23.550
is very powerful and important.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:24.870
And I feel that that's something

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.970
that we haven't seen before
in the other versions.

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:27.803
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:02:27.803 --> 00:02:28.890
- So I love that.

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:31.110
Lolita, my character,
she's a modern woman,

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.760
she breaks the stereotypes.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:36.690
She doesn't try to fit
into like society rules,

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.670
and I feel so proud of it.

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.920
- I know. It looks so
good. I'm so excited.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:43.530
I love anything action-filled
with like a little humor.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:44.363
and I think the-

00:02:45.305 --> 00:02:46.138
- Yeah.

00:02:46.138 --> 00:02:48.000
We had a lot of physical
training for that, you know.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.340
- I heard... Wait, you
ride horses in it as well?

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.173
- Yeah.

00:02:51.173 --> 00:02:52.410
- But you're allergic to horses.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:54.000
- I am. I'm actually am.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:58.290
But it was my secret
until I booked the job

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.215
because I was like-

00:02:59.215 --> 00:03:00.048
- [Kevin] (voice drowned out)

00:03:00.048 --> 00:03:00.881
- How did they feel when you said,

00:03:00.881 --> 00:03:01.981
"I'm allergic to horses" all of a sudden?

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:03.660
- Oh God, they freaked out.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.737
They were like, "This is not happening.

00:03:05.737 --> 00:03:06.990
"She's always with a horse."

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.367
And I was like, "Guys, it's totally okay.

00:03:09.367 --> 00:03:11.640
"I won't die. I can breathe."

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.200
I mean, worst-case scenario

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.482
I would look like a different person.

00:03:15.482 --> 00:03:16.315
(audience laughing)

00:03:16.315 --> 00:03:17.250
- Which is kind of not good.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:18.330
- [Kevin] Second season.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.310
- Like my eyes would go smaller,

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:22.710
like my lips would go bigger.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:23.543
- [Kevin] Yeah.
- [Kelly Clarkson] Nice.

00:03:23.543 --> 00:03:25.140
- But other than that, it's fine.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:27.090
- Yeah, you just take a pill or something.

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:28.593
- [Renata Notni] Exactly.

00:03:28.593 --> 00:03:29.426
- Yeah.

00:03:29.426 --> 00:03:30.259
- [Renata Notni] It's fine.

00:03:30.259 --> 00:03:31.092
- Oh my God, I love actors.

00:03:31.092 --> 00:03:31.925
It's the best thing.

00:03:31.925 --> 00:03:32.758
I never knew any before this show,

00:03:32.758 --> 00:03:33.840
and now five seasons in,

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.850
all of you lie when
you say, about the job.

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:37.330
It's like, "Of course, I..." Yeah.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:38.533
- Sometimes you have to do it, right?

00:03:38.533 --> 00:03:39.930
- No, no, not sometimes. All the time.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.007
It's every actor that comes
on this couch is like,

00:03:42.007 --> 00:03:43.290
"Yeah, I never done that before."

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.000
But it's like, "Yeah, I
hurdled in high school."

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:45.833
What?

00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:46.666
- [Renata Notni] Yeah, totally.

00:03:46.666 --> 00:03:47.940
- Yeah, I believe it's fascinating.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.170
But it's very bold,

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:50.003
because then you're just like,

00:03:50.003 --> 00:03:50.836
"Yep, I'm gonna get on this horse

00:03:50.836 --> 00:03:51.750
"and pretend like I rack."

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:52.583
- Of course. I was like,

00:03:52.583 --> 00:03:54.600
"I'm not gonna lose this opportunity

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:55.433
because of my allergies."

00:03:55.433 --> 00:03:56.266
- [Kelly Clarkson] It's very smart.

00:03:56.266 --> 00:03:58.260
- I was like, "That's my secret."

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:00.270
But then I couldn't lie to the doctor.

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:01.380
So it was like, "Okay, I have to...

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.030
- So then the second
season, what you do is,

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:04.260
when you gain all the power

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.580
and the show's doing really well,

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:09.600
you just ride a
non-allergenic, like a poodle.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:10.872
You ride a poodle.

00:04:10.872 --> 00:04:11.705
- A poodle? A poodle?

00:04:11.705 --> 00:04:12.538
- [Renata Notni] Exactly.

00:04:12.538 --> 00:04:13.371
- Or like a carriage.

00:04:13.371 --> 00:04:14.204
- [Renata Notni] Exactly.

00:04:14.204 --> 00:04:15.037
- In the carriage.

00:04:15.037 --> 00:04:16.050
- That's a great idea.
That's a great idea.

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:16.883
- [Kevin] You guys, you've got the power.

00:04:16.883 --> 00:04:17.716
- He's got ideas.

00:04:17.716 --> 00:04:19.500
Well let's do a quick
commercial break, everybody.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:23.850
You can see Renata's horse
allergy in action on Zorro.

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.503
It's available on Prime Video.

